## States & keyboard

- **Keyboard:** Tab goes through the name input, Save, then Delete. Enter in the input submits the form. Every control shows a 2px focus ring.
- **Default and hover:** hover lifts a button by 1px and active presses it down. Reduced motion turns off the movement.
- **Disabled:** Save stays disabled until the name changes.
- **Validation:** an empty name shows an inline error and moves focus back to the input.
- **Saving:** while saving, the button is dimmed and disabled, and the form has `data-state="saving"`.
- **Loading:** setting `data-state="loading"` hides the input and shows a skeleton of exactly the same height, so nothing shifts. The shimmer stops under reduced motion.
- **Error:** a failed save shows an inline alert beside the form with a Retry button. The typed name is kept.
- **Empty search or filter:** not applicable, because there is no list on this screen.

